+++ b/.changeset/markdown-editor-native-panel-checkpoints.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+---
+'element-plus': minor
+---
+
+Retain immutable original native active-node, scroll-anchor, outline, search and
+settled attachment-state checkpoints in the existing single editor session custody.
+Expose real panel refs and readPanelState on the same original snapshot. Refuse
+missing projection/DOM owners, queued continuations, unsettled/unknown attachment
+dispatches and revoked original job custody; do not mint replacement controllers.
+Complete application snapshot, resources, disposal and eviction remain unavailable.
